{"suttaId":"tha-ap436","source":{"db":"E-Piṭaka (dhammanana/epitaka_app)","book":"Ap-ii","vriCode":"s0510m2.mul","paras":[646,672],"vripara":"35"},"segments":{"tha-ap436:0.3":"Ñāṇatthavikattheraapadānaṃ","tha-ap436:1.1":"“Kaṇikāraṃva jalitaṃ, dīparukkhaṃva jotitaṃ;","tha-ap436:1.3":"Kañcanaṃva virocantaṃ, addasaṃ dvipaduttamaṃ.","tha-ap436:2.1":"“Kamaṇḍaluṃ ṭhapetvāna, vākacīrañca kuṇḍikaṃ;","tha-ap436:2.3":"Ekaṃsaṃ ajinaṃ katvā, buddhaseṭṭhaṃ thaviṃ ahaṃ.","tha-ap436:3.1":"“‘Tamandhakāraṃ vidhamaṃ, mohajālasamākulaṃ;","tha-ap436:3.3":"Ñāṇālokaṃ dassetvāna, nittiṇṇosi mahāmuni.","tha-ap436:4.1":"“‘Samuddharasimaṃ lokaṃ, sabbāvantamanuttaraṃ;","tha-ap436:4.3":"Ñāṇe te upamā natthi, yāvatājagatogati [yāvatā ca gatogati (pī. ka.)].","tha-ap436:5.1":"“‘Tena ñāṇena sabbaññū, iti buddho pavuccati;","tha-ap436:5.3":"Vandāmi taṃ mahāvīraṃ, sabbaññutamanāvaraṃ’.","tha-ap436:6.1":"“Satasahassito kappe, buddhaseṭṭhaṃ thaviṃ ahaṃ;","tha-ap436:6.3":"Duggatiṃ nābhijānāmi, ñāṇatthavāyidaṃ phalaṃ;","tha-ap436:7.1":"“Kilesā jhāpitā mayhaṃ … pe … viharāmi anāsavo;","tha-ap436:8.1":"“Svāgataṃ vata me āsi … pe … kataṃ buddhassa sāsanaṃ.","tha-ap436:9.1":"“Paṭisambhidā catasso … pe … kataṃ buddhassa sāsanaṃ”.","tha-ap436:10.1":"Itthaṃ sudaṃ āyasmā ñāṇatthaviko thero imā gāthāyo Abhāsitthāti.","tha-ap436:11.1":"Ñāṇatthavikattherassāpadānaṃ catutthaṃ."},"attha":null,"tika":null}
